// Owning team   : Team 3 (Platform)
// Topic prefix  : chora.a2a.invocation.*
//
// Lifecycle: STARTED -> {COMPLETED | FAILED | GUARDRAIL_BLOCKED}.
// Each invocation carries cryptographic hashes of request + response
